# The Quick Start potential of Tadah.MLIP (docs/source/quickstart/pot.tadah at
# Tadah.MLIP 0df2370, 1.6.0): a smooth-cutoff D2_Blip pair term plus a
# DM_mBlipEnv embedding, M_KRR Kern_Linear. pair_style tadah evaluates it with
# the generic many-body kernel (compute_2b_mb_half: reverse comm of the
# densities and pair descriptors, forward comm of dF/drho), which it does not
# collapse. Used by tests/mpi/check_pair_tadah_mpi.py. A copy: regenerating the
# Quick Start potential leaves this file as it is.
# The lines of the keys EWEIGHT, FWEIGHT, SWEIGHT and WDBFILE_AUTO, which
# Tadah! 1.6.0 retired and no load of a potential reads, are left out.
ATOM              Ta
BIAS              false
CEMBFUNC          0.5   0.75   1   1.25   1.5
CGRID2B           1   2.43333333333333357   3.8666666666666667   5.29999999999999982
CGRIDMB           2.87999999999999989
DIMER             false   0   false
ESHIFT_ATOM       false
ESHIFT_DBATOM     false
FORCE             false
INIT2B            true
INITMB            true
LAMBDA            9.99999999999999955e-08
LSCALE            1
MODEL             M_KRR   Kern_Linear   1
NORM              false
OALGO             1
RCTYPE2B          Cut_Cos
RCTYPEMB          Cut_Cos
RCUT2B            5.29999999999999982
RCUTENV           0.599999999999999978
RCUTMB            5
SEMBFUNC          2   2   2   2   2
SGRID2B           0.100000000000000033   0.21544346900318842   0.464158883361277919   0.999999999999999889
SGRIDMB           8
STRESS            true
TYPE2B            D2_Blip   4   4   Ta   Ta
TYPEMB            DM_mBlipEnv   0   1   1   5   5   Ta   Ta
WATOM             0.308999999999999997
WEIGHTS           133.357774127816555   -123.755171524655708   -10.4804763244958963   -18.0240635733812411   -6.3685917658913116   4.13446130558423164   -8.25236089850869803   3.95181987589451467   -6.04877887227442557
ZERO_COM_FORCE    false

